# Windows patch series for ffmpeg, applied after series.common (the
# videotoolbox/dolby-vision stack lives in series.apple). CVE-2026-107675 is
# Windows-only because this build enables FFmpeg's libssh SFTP handler. Patches
# are staged into mpv-winbuild-cmake and applied by the injected PATCH_COMMAND.
0039-libssh-verify-host-key.patch
